    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 46,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "his drawings, his paintings, his inventions, his writings",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F2E9A29971",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "But we do not know his face.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26A7E557F7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "Thousands of books have been written about him, but there's controversy, and it remains, about his looks.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "919EF5C9B8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 69,
        "text": "Even this well-known portrait is not accepted by many art historians.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C4145B2DCC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "So, what do you think?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BB42C4E0B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "Is this the face of Leonardo da Vinci or isn't it?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "34CA523334",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 15,
        "text": "Let's find out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "19249A21A2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "Leonardo was a man that drew everything around him.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7C82B17AFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "everything",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "459177BA73",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 82,
        "text": "He drew people, anatomy, plants, animals, landscapes, buildings, water, everything",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9EA91ADE7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "But no faces?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B53EB7CBA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 28,
        "text": "I find that hard to believe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4EDB6483E9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 61,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "en face",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD4F5175DD",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 72,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "three-quarters",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2E4220CC39",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "So, surely a passionate drawer like Leonardo must have made self-portraits from time to time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E002C8426",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "So let's try to find them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7FF4789AF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 91,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "his face looking at us",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8763A0BDDE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 77,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "we would find",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "22E48935A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
