    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "looked...looked",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A31396C43E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 21,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "you see them here",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E89FD6D901",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "Which ones of these could be self-portraits?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "56F790EFDF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "Well, for that they have to be done as we just saw, en face or three-quarters.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F6F56F9AC9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "So we can eliminate all the profiles.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "99238B4BBA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "It also has to be sufficiently detailed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD1CF5D50B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "So we can also eliminate the ones that are very vague or very stylized.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F0F8158D71",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "And we know from his contemporaries that Leonardo was a very handsome, even beautiful man.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3420C2F996",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 58,
        "text": "So we can also eliminate the ugly ones or the caricatures.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1E8D53FF32",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "And look what happens",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0230170274",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Laughter)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26DA22420E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "And here they are.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A73A79BBB6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 13,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "the old man is there",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5256C751B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "as is this famous pen drawing of the Homo Vitruvianus.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06DD7017D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "And lastly, the only portrait of a male that Leonardo painted, \"The Musician.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DD655E6284",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "Before we go into these faces, I should explain why I have some right to talk about them.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E18855ED7C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "I've made more than 1,100 portraits myself for newspapers, over the course of 300 -- 30 years, sorry, 30 years only.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23D391AE57",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "(Laughter) But there are 1,100, and very few artists have drawn so many faces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A988DC38ED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "So I know a little about drawing and analyzing faces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CE8AE2EC3C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 44,
        "text": "OK, now let's look at these three portraits.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4C0C06115",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "hold onto your seats",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CD33C8184F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "hold onto your seats",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B70B557EC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 89,
        "endOffset": 200,
        "text": "same broad forehead, the horizontal eyebrows, the long nose, the curved lips and the small, well-developed chin",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D862BC29C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 49,
        "text": "I couldn't believe my eyes when I first saw that.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "40BDB36B7F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 57,
        "text": "There is no reason why these portraits should look alike.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2217156C66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 15,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "look for portraits that had the characteristics of a self-portrait, and look, they are very similar",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5A1D901CCB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "Now, are they made in the right order?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9A6DA9D019",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 35,
        "text": "The young man should be made first.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9662D426CA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 81,
        "text": "And as you see here from the years that they were created, it is indeed the case.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FFA84453B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 33,
        "text": "They are made in the right order.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "43311058B9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "What was the age of Leonardo at the time?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "947E7CAA7F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 14,
        "text": "Does that fit?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C9582D6FC9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "Yes, it does.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
