        ]
      },
      "id": "757315B76C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "He was 33, 38 and 63 when these were made.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D28C10858D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "So we have three pictures, potentially of the same person of the same age as Leonardo at the time.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D9837C19F1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "But how do we know it's him, and not someone else?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E16DBD38C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "Well, we need a reference.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C56E4BE634",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "And here's the only picture of Leonardo that's widely accepted.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BA4BA27E6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 84,
        "text": "It's a statue made by Verrocchio, of David, for which Leonardo posed as a boy of 15.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "696F29DDE5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 114,
        "text": "And if we now compare the face of the statue, with the face of the musician, you see the very same features again.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "323A006CB4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 91,
        "text": "The statue is the reference, and it connects the identity of Leonardo to those three faces.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BFBED83FD3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, this story has not yet been published.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "771976B3B0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 60,
        "text": "It's only proper that you here at TED hear and see it first.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F1535E18E1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "The icon of icons finally has a face.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BAB338C12",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 30,
        "text": "Here he is: Leonardo da Vinci.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "10BFE5F8CE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "07F19E755B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}